---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import OrbStage from '../components/OrbStage.astro';
---

<Base title="Niyora · Calm in 60 seconds">
  <OrbStage />

  <main class="content">
    <section class="hero" data-hue="30" data-sat="70%">
      <div class="brand">Niyora</div>
      <h1>Calm in 60 seconds.</h1>
      <p class="subhead">A quiet menu-bar companion for your Mac. It watches the rhythm of your day, then nudges you to breathe right before stress takes hold.</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a id="primary-download" href="https://downloads.niyora.com/Niyora-0.1.0-AppleSilicon.dmg" class="cta" data-arch="apple-silicon">
          <span class="cta-label">Download for Mac</span>
          <span class="cta-sub" id="primary-download-sub">Apple Silicon · 28 MB</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#how" class="cta ghost">How it works</a>
      </div>
      <div class="meta">
        Free. Nothing leaves your Mac.
        <a href="#downloads" id="other-builds-link">Other builds</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="how" data-hue="335" data-sat="70%">
      <div class="eyebrow">How it knows</div>
      <h2>No wearables. No health data. Just your Mac.</h2>
      <p class="lead">No Apple Health. No Oura. No Apple Watch. Niyora reads what your computer already shows about your day, then nudges you at the right moment. The whole system is built on research that maps work patterns to stress and recovery.</p>
      <div class="signals">
        <div class="signal-card">
          <div class="num">No wearable</div>
          <p>You already have a device that knows when you're working hard. We use that, nothing else.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="signal-card">
          <div class="num">No biometrics</div>
          <p>We never ask for heart rate, sleep, steps, or any health information. There is no integration to opt into.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="signal-card">
          <div class="num">Research backed</div>
          <p>The signals we read map to validated stress and recovery findings, not guesswork.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section data-hue="280" data-sat="65%">
      <div class="eyebrow">Your soul, your way</div>
      <h2>Five rings. Fourteen practices. The app grows with you.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Every session lights up your soul. As you keep practicing, your ring fills and the next tier opens, unlocking new techniques and deeper sounds. You don't get a streak counter. You get a quiet sense of arrival.</p>
      <div class="tiers">
        <span class="tier-pill t1">Spark</span>
        <span class="tier-pill t2">Glow</span>
        <span class="tier-pill t3">Shine</span>
        <span class="tier-pill t4">Radiance</span>
        <span class="tier-pill t5">Brilliance</span>
      </div>
      <p class="lead afterword">Fourteen practices in total. Pranayama breathing rooted in yoga. Mindfulness moments grounded in CBT and self-compassion. Each session paired with ambient sound that fades in as you start and out as you finish.</p>
    </section>

    <section data-hue="230" data-sat="65%">
      <div class="eyebrow">Research backed</div>
      <h2>Every practice has a paper behind it.</h2>
      <p class="lead">No mystic claims. Just techniques validated in peer-reviewed research, clearly cited so you can read the source.</p>
      <div class="papers">
        <div class="paper">
          <div class="title">Box Breathing</div>
          <div class="cite">Used in Navy SEAL training. Lowers cortisol, improves HRV.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="paper">
          <div class="title">4-7-8 Breath</div>
          <div class="cite">Activates parasympathetic nervous system. Weil, A. Spontaneous Healing.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="paper">
          <div class="title">Diaphragmatic Breathing</div>
          <div class="cite">Ma et al, 2017. Reduces stress and negative affect.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="paper">
          <div class="title">PSS-4 Check-in</div>
          <div class="cite">Cohen, 1983. Validated 4-item perceived stress scale.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="paper">
          <div class="title">Trataka (Soft Gaze)</div>
          <div class="cite">Improves attention and selective focus. Talwadkar et al, 2014.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="paper">
          <div class="title">Self-Compassion</div>
          <div class="cite">Neff, 2003. Linked to reduced anxiety and rumination.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section data-hue="210" data-sat="60%">
      <div class="eyebrow">Privacy, locally</div>
      <h2>Nothing leaves your Mac. Ever.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Most wellness apps want your account, your data, and a server log of your worst days. Niyora wants none of it.</p>
      <div class="privacy-points">
        <div class="privacy-point">
          <div class="check">✓</div>
          <h3>No accounts</h3>
          <p>Open the app. Start breathing. That is the entire onboarding.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="privacy-point">
          <div class="check">✓</div>
          <h3>No telemetry</h3>
          <p>The app makes zero outbound network requests of its own. Verifiable in source.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="privacy-point">
          <div class="check">✓</div>
          <h3>Local storage</h3>
          <p>Sessions and check-ins live in your app container. Never read off-device.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="privacy-point">
          <div class="check">✓</div>
          <h3>Open source</h3>
          <p>Read every line on GitHub. Trust through transparency, not promises.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="founder" data-hue="335" data-sat="60%">
      <div class="eyebrow">From the founder</div>
      <p class="quote">"I'm a doctor in the Indian system of medicine. Studying yoga and then working in tech, I felt the gap every day. The slow, time-tested practices that actually shift the nervous system, almost never make it into the rhythm of a working day. I built Niyora for myself first. Now I'm sharing it with you."</p>
      <div class="signature">Neha Prasad. Doctor, builder, founder of Niyora.</div>
    </section>

    <section class="love" data-hue="20" data-sat="65%">
      <div class="eyebrow">Pay in love</div>
      <h2>We don't want your money. We don't want your data. Just tell us how you feel.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Most apps ask for both. We know how stressful that feels. So Niyora is free, makes no network calls, and asks for nothing. The one thing we'd love is your honest word on how it landed for you.</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a href="mailto:support@niyora.com?subject=How%20Niyora%20made%20me%20feel" class="cta">Share what you think</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/neha-prasad-ux/niyora/issues/new" class="cta ghost">Rate and review</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="downloads" class="downloads" data-hue="30" data-sat="70%">
      <div class="eyebrow">Downloads</div>
      <h2>Pick the build for your Mac.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Both are signed by Apple Developer ID, notarized, and stapled. Drag to Applications and you're done.</p>
      <div class="download-grid">
        <a href="https://downloads.niyora.com/Niyora-0.1.0-AppleSilicon.dmg" class="download-card">
          <div class="dl-arch">Apple Silicon</div>
          <div class="dl-detail">M1, M2, M3, M4. macOS 11 Big Sur or later.</div>
          <div class="dl-meta">v0.1.0 · 28 MB · arm64</div>
        </a>
        <a href="https://downloads.niyora.com/Niyora-0.1.0-Intel.dmg" class="download-card">
          <div class="dl-arch">Intel</div>
          <div class="dl-detail">Pre-2020 MacBook, iMac, Mac mini. macOS 10.15 Catalina or later.</div>
          <div class="dl-meta">v0.1.0 · 28 MB · x86_64</div>
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="meta unsure">Unsure? Apple menu → About This Mac. If it says "Apple M…" you want Apple Silicon. Otherwise Intel.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="final-cta" data-hue="30" data-sat="70%">
      <h2>Take the next breath.</h2>
      <p class="lead">It takes a minute to install. Sixty seconds to feel different.</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a id="final-download" href="https://downloads.niyora.com/Niyora-0.1.0-AppleSilicon.dmg" class="cta" data-arch="apple-silicon">Download for Mac</a>
      </div>
      <div class="meta">Apple Silicon and Intel. macOS 10.15 and later.</div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script>
    // Detect user's Mac architecture and switch the primary CTA to the matching DMG.
    // We default to Apple Silicon (the majority of new Macs) and only flip to Intel
    // when we can confidently detect it. Browsers mask architecture in navigator.userAgent
    // for privacy, but the WebGL renderer string usually reveals it on macOS.
    (function () {
      const apple = 'https://downloads.niyora.com/Niyora-0.1.0-AppleSilicon.dmg';
      const intel = 'https://downloads.niyora.com/Niyora-0.1.0-Intel.dmg';

      function detectArch() {
        try {
          const canvas = document.createElement('canvas');
          const gl = canvas.getContext('webgl') || canvas.getContext('experimental-webgl');
          if (!gl) return null;
          const ext = gl.getExtension('WEBGL_debug_renderer_info');
          const renderer = ext ? gl.getParameter(ext.UNMASKED_RENDERER_WEBGL) : '';
          if (!renderer) return null;
          if (/Apple\s*(M|GPU)/i.test(renderer)) return 'apple-silicon';
          if (/Intel/i.test(renderer)) return 'intel';
          return null;
        } catch (_) { return null; }
      }

      const isMac = /Mac|iPhone|iPad/i.test(navigator.userAgent);
      if (!isMac) return;

      const arch = detectArch();
      if (arch !== 'intel') return;

      const sub = document.getElementById('primary-download-sub');
      ['primary-download', 'final-download'].forEach(function (id) {
        const a = document.getElementById(id);
        if (a) { a.href = intel; a.dataset.arch = 'intel'; }
      });
      if (sub) sub.textContent = 'Intel · 28 MB';
    })();
  </script>

  <footer>
    <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a>
    <a href="/terms/">Terms</a>
    <a href="https://github.com/neha-prasad-ux/niyora">GitHub</a>
    <a href="mailto:support@niyora.com">Contact</a>
    <div class="copyright">© 2026 Niyora. Built quietly in Norway.</div>
  </footer>
</Base>

<style>
  .content { position: relative; z-index: 2; }

  section {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 80px 24px;
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: hsla(var(--orb-hue), 50%, 75%, 0.7);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    transition: color 1.4s ease;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 56px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 38px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.3px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94);
    max-width: 720px;
  }
  h3 {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  p {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
    max-width: 640px;
  }
  p.lead {
    font-size: 20px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }
  p.afterword { margin-top: 36px; }

  .hero { text-align: center; }
  .hero .brand {
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .hero h1 { font-size: 64px; }
  .hero .subhead {
    font-size: 22px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    margin-bottom: 48px;
    max-width: 580px;
  }
  .cta-row { display: flex; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
  .cta {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 16px 36px;
    border-radius: 32px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg,
      hsla(var(--orb-hue), 60%, 50%, 0.9),
      hsla(var(--orb-hue), 50%, 35%, 0.9));
    border: 1px solid hsla(var(--orb-hue), 50%, 65%, 0.4);
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.98);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    transition: all 0.3s ease, background 1.4s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 28px hsla(var(--orb-hue), 50%, 40%, 0.35);
  }
  .cta:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 10px 36px hsla(var(--orb-hue), 50%, 40%, 0.5); }
  .cta.ghost {
    background: transparent;
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
    box-shadow: none;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
  }
  .cta.ghost:hover { border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4); color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95); }
  .meta { margin-top: 24px; font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35); }

  .signals {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 18px;
    margin-top: 40px;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 880px;
  }
  .signal-card {
    padding: 20px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: rgba(20, 18, 32, 0.4);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  }
  .signal-card .num {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: hsla(var(--orb-hue), 60%, 78%, 0.95);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    transition: color 1.4s ease;
  }
  .signal-card p { font-size: 14px; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55); }

  .tiers {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 36px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .tier-pill {
    padding: 10px 18px;
    border-radius: 24px;
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    border: 1px solid;
  }
  .tier-pill.t1 { color: hsl(30, 70%, 75%); border-color: hsla(30, 70%, 60%, 0.4); }
  .tier-pill.t2 { color: hsl(335, 70%, 80%); border-color: hsla(335, 70%, 65%, 0.4); }
  .tier-pill.t3 { color: hsl(280, 65%, 80%); border-color: hsla(280, 65%, 65%, 0.4); }
  .tier-pill.t4 { color: hsl(230, 65%, 80%); border-color: hsla(230, 65%, 65%, 0.4); }
  .tier-pill.t5 { color: hsl(210, 65%, 82%); border-color: hsla(210, 65%, 65%, 0.4); }

  .practices {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 18px;
    margin-top: 40px;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 880px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .practice-group h3 {
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: hsla(var(--orb-hue), 50%, 70%, 0.75);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    transition: color 1.4s ease;
  }
  .practice-group ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; }
  .practice-group li {
    padding: 8px 0;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  }

  .papers {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 18px;
    margin-top: 36px;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 880px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .paper {
    padding: 18px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgba(20, 18, 32, 0.4);
  }
  .paper .title { font-size: 14px; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85); font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .paper .cite { font-size: 12px; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4); }

  .privacy-points {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
    margin-top: 32px;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 880px;
  }
  .privacy-point .check {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: hsla(var(--orb-hue), 50%, 50%, 0.2);
    border: 1px solid hsla(var(--orb-hue), 50%, 60%, 0.5);
    color: hsla(var(--orb-hue), 70%, 85%, 1);
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 22px;
    font-size: 13px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    transition: all 1.4s ease;
  }
  .privacy-point h3 { font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .privacy-point p { font-size: 14px; }

  .founder { text-align: center; max-width: 640px; }
  .founder .quote {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .founder .signature {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
  }

  .love { text-align: center; max-width: 720px; }
  .love h2 { margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .love .lead { margin-bottom: 36px; }

  .cta-label { display: block; }
  .cta-sub {
    display: block;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-top: 4px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
    letter-spacing: 0.3px;
  }
  .meta a { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55); text-decoration: underline; margin-left: 10px; }
  .meta a:hover { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9); }

  .downloads { text-align: center; max-width: 880px; }
  .download-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 18px;
    margin-top: 36px;
    width: 100%;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .download-card {
    padding: 24px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: rgba(20, 18, 32, 0.5);
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
  }
  .download-card:hover {
    border-color: hsla(var(--orb-hue), 60%, 60%, 0.5);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
  .download-card .dl-arch { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .download-card .dl-detail { font-size: 14px; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65); margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .download-card .dl-meta { font-size: 12px; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4); letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
  .meta.unsure { margin-top: 24px; }

  .final-cta { text-align: center; }
  .final-cta h2 { margin-bottom: 32px; }

  footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 60px 24px 80px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    font-size: 13px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }
  footer a { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45); text-decoration: none; margin: 0 14px; }
  footer a:hover { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); }
  footer .copyright { margin-top: 16px; font-size: 12px; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2); }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .hero h1 { font-size: 40px; }
    h1 { font-size: 36px; }
    h2 { font-size: 28px; }
    p.lead { font-size: 17px; }
    section { padding: 60px 20px; }
  }
</style>
